 unexpectedly snapped a picture of me and changed my career path from teaching to modeling?\u201d Another friend revealed a secret to me. She said that she was having second thoughts about studying medicine. What if her parents hadn't pushed her into that profession? Would she have traveled the world and become a journalist?", "id": 1}, {"time": "31000", "image": "engenn9le11ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "If she had the courage to defy her parents and travel, she could have discovered a new passion. The possibilities are endless and in her case there is still time. Using our imagination to see how we might have had an alternate reality helps us to understand the choices we make in the moment. While we might have some regrets, we also realize how fortunate we are when we ask what if. If I hadn't started this blog, I wouldn't have connected with so many wonderful people. If I hadn't won the lottery I couldn't have traveled to Europe and changed my outlook on life.", "id": 2}, {"time": "69000", "image": "engenn9le11ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "If you hadn't taken an opportunity that you took, you would have been regretful. You would say I wish I had kissed that boy, or, I wish I had tried skydiving, I could tell you what it was like to fly. I wish I hadn't been afraid, I would have succeeded! I wish I had gone on that trip. I should have told him how I felt. I wish I had used my time more wisely. So by learning from our past we can certainly make our future brighter.", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}